PannerNode::getAzimuthElevation normalized the source-listener vector before
testing it for zero, so a source at the listener divided by a zero length and its
NaNs resolved to an azimuth of 90 degrees (hard right). The zero test now precedes
the normalization: azimuth and elevation are 0, as Web Audio specifies.

